    <string name="manual_ai_title">Neyron tarmoqdan foydalanib testni qanday yaratish mumkin?</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_info_one">Tutor mobil ilovasining neyron tarmoqlar bilan to\'g\'ridan-to\'g\'ri integratsiyasi yo\'q. Bu bizga barcha foydalanuvchilar uchun bepul bo\'lib qolish imkonini beradi.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_info_two">Biroq, siz osonlikcha har qanday mashhur neyron tarmoqdan (masalan, DeepSeek, ChatGPT) test yaratish uchun foydalanishingiz va keyin uni Tutor ilovasiga yuklashingiz mumkin. Bu mutlaqo bepul.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_move">Qisqa video ko\'rsatma:</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_move_btn">Video Darsni Ko\'rish</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_title">Qadam-baqadam ko\'rsatma:</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_first">1. Prompt (shablon) tayyorlang</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_first_description">Tutor ilovasidan maxsus promptni nusxalang. Bu shablon neyron tarmoqqa test yaratish uchun to\'g\'ri formatni aytadi.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_first_btn_first">Fayl uchun promptni nusxalash</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_first_btn_second">Havolalar uchun promptni nusxalash</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_second">2. Neyron tarmoqda test yarating</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_second_description">Har qanday qulay neyron tarmoqqa o\'ting. Bizning jamoamiz DeepSeekni tavsiya qiladi — u bu vazifani a\'lo darajada bajaradi.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_second_btn">DeepSeekga O\'tish</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_second_description_two">• Nusxalangan promptni neyron tarmoq chatiga qo\'ying.\n• Material qo\'shing: matnli faylni (.txt, .doc) biriktiring yoki test yaratish kerak bo\'lgan sayt/maqolaga havolani ko\'rsating.\n• Neyron tarmoq tomonidan berilgan tayyor testni nusxalang.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three">3. Testni Tutor ilovasiga yuklang</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three_description_first">Tutor ilovasiga test yaratish bo\'limiga qayting. Nusxalangan test matnini buferdan qo\'ying.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three_btn_first">Buferdan testni qo\'yish</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three_description_second">Yoki faylni yuklang: agar neyron tarmoq testni .json fayliga saqlagan bo\'lsa, uni xotiradan tanlang.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three_btn_second">Faylni Tanlash</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_finish">Tayyor! Test yaratildi va foydalanishga tayyor</string>

